### Level 1 API requests — open in VS Code with Thunder Client / REST Client, or import into Postman.
@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### List products (filters: search, category, sort=price|-price|name)
GET {{base}}/products?sort=-price

### Create product
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "USB-C Hub", "price": 34.9, "stock": 20, "category": "Accessories", "description": "7-in-1 hub" }

### Get one (replace :id)
GET {{base}}/products/:id

### Replace product
PUT {{base}}/products/:id
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "USB-C Hub Pro", "price": 44.9, "stock": 12, "category": "Accessories" }

### Partial update
PATCH {{base}}/products/:id
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stock": 0 }

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/products/:id

### Validation error example (422)
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "x", "price": -5 }
